<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmation de Réservation - Maternia</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset */
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f0f4f8; color: #2d3748; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

        /* Wrapper */
        .email-wrapper { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; }

        /* Card principale */
        .email-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }

        /* ====== HEADER ====== */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f472b6 0%, #ec4899 40%, #c026d3 100%);
            padding: 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header-inner {
            padding: 40px 40px 50px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -60px; right: -60px;
            width: 220px; height: 220px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 40px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 100% 100% 0 0;
        }
        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .brand-icon {
            width: 46px; height: 46px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }
        .brand-name {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: white;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .header-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* ====== HERO STATUS ====== */
        .hero {
            padding: 32px 40px 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .check-circle {
            width: 76px; height: 76px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5, #a7f3d0);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(16,185,129,0.2);
        }
        .hero-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1a202c;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .hero-sub {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .hero-sub strong {
            color: #ec4899;
        }
        .ref-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf2f8, #fce7f3);
            border: 2px solid #f9a8d4;
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 8px 24px;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #be185d;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        /* ====== DIVIDER ====== */
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #f3e8ff, #fce7f3, #f3e8ff, transparent);
            margin: 0 40px;
        }

        /* ====== SECTION ====== */
        .section {
            padding: 28px 40px;
        }
        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .section-icon {
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf2f8, #fce7f3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .section-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ec4899;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        /* ====== INFO GRID ====== */
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .info-cell {
            background: #fafbfc;
            border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
        }
        .info-cell.full {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }
        .cell-label {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.8px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .cell-value {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
        }
        .cell-value.accent {
            color: #ec4899;
        }
        .cell-value.highlight {
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        /* ====== STATUT BADGE ====== */
        .statut-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5, #a7f3d0);
            color: #065f46;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* ====== MEET BLOCK ====== */
        .meet-block {
            margin: 0 24px 28px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a73e8 0%, #0d5cb6 50%, #5e35b1 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 32px rgba(26,115,232,0.3);
            position: relative;
        }
        .meet-block::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -40px; right: -40px;
            width: 160px; height: 160px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .meet-inner {
            padding: 30px 32px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .meet-logo {
            font-size: 44px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }
        .meet-heading {
            color: white;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .meet-desc {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .meet-cta {
            display: inline-block;
            background: white;
            color: #1a73e8;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 15px;
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }
        .meet-link-text {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-top: 14px;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        /* ====== STEPS ====== */
        .steps-list { padding: 0; }
        .step-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
        }
        .step-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .step-num {
            width: 30px; height: 30px; min-width: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f472b6, #ec4899);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .step-text {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.55;
            padding-top: 4px;
        }
        .step-text strong { color: #1e293b; }

        /* ====== ALERT ====== */
        .alert-row {
            margin: 0 24px 28px;
            background: #fffbeb;
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: #78350f;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .alert-row strong { color: #92400e; }

        /* ====== FOOTER ====== */
        .footer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%);
            padding: 36px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer-brand {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #f9a8d4;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }
        .footer-tagline {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .footer-sep {
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer-links {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .footer-link {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
            font-size: 11px;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }
        .footer-copy {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* ====== RESPONSIVE ====== */
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .email-wrapper { padding: 16px 8px; }
            .header-inner, .hero, .section, .footer { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
            .divider { margin: 0 24px; }
            .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .meet-block { margin: 0 16px 24px; }
            .alert-row { margin: 0 16px 24px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="email-wrapper">
<div class="email-card">

    <!-- ===== HEADER ===== -->
    <div class="header">
        <div class="header-inner">
            <div class="brand">
                <div class="brand-icon">🌸</div>
                <span class="brand-name">Maternia</span>
            </div>
            <div class="header-badge">✉️ &nbsp;Confirmation de Réservation</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
    <div class="hero">
        <div class="check-circle">✅</div>
        <div class="hero-title">Votre rendez-vous est confirmé !</div>
        <div class="hero-sub">
            Bonjour <strong>{{ reservation.prenomClient }} {{ reservation.nomClient }}</strong>,<br>
            votre réservation a bien été enregistrée.
        </div>
        <div class="ref-pill">Réf : #{{ reservation.reference }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <!-- ===== INFOS PATIENT ===== -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-icon">👤</div>
            <span class="section-label">Informations Patient</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Nom complet</div>
                <div class="cell-value highlight">{{ reservation.prenomClient }} {{ reservation.nomClient }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Type de patient</div>
                <div class="cell-value">
                    {% if reservation.typePatient == 'BEBE' %}
                        👶 Bébé
                    {% else %}
                        🤰 Maman
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Email</div>
                <div class="cell-value accent">{{ reservation.emailClient }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Téléphone</div>
                <div class="cell-value">{{ reservation.telephoneClient }}</div>
            </div>
            {% if reservation.typePatient == 'MAMAN' and reservation.moisGrossesse %}
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Mois de grossesse</div>
                <div class="cell-value accent">{{ reservation.moisGrossesse }} mois</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if reservation.typePatient == 'BEBE' and reservation.dateNaissanceBebe %}
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Date de naissance</div>
                <div class="cell-value">{{ reservation.dateNaissanceBebe|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <!-- ===== DÉTAILS RDV ===== -->
    {% if reservation.consultationCreneau %}
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-icon">📅</div>
            <span class="section-label">Détails du Rendez-vous</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-grid">
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Médecin</div>
                <div class="cell-value highlight">Dr. {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.nomMedecin }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Spécialité</div>
                <div class="cell-value">{{ reservation.consultationCreneau.consultation.categorie }}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Date</div>
                <div class="cell-value accent highlight">
                    {% if reservation.consultationCreneau.jour %}
                        📆 {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.jour|date('d/m/Y') }}
                    {% else %}
                        📆 {{ reservation.dateReservation|date('d/m/Y') }}
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Horaire</div>
                <div class="cell-value accent highlight">
                    {% if reservation.consultationCreneau.heureDebut and reservation.consultationCreneau.heureFin %}
                        🕐 {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.heureDebut|date('H:i') }} — {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.heureFin|date('H:i') }}
                    {% else %}
                        À confirmer
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Statut</div>
                <div class="cell-value">
                    <span class="statut-badge">✅ {{ reservation.statutReservation }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-cell">
                <div class="cell-label">Durée estimée</div>
                <div class="cell-value">
                    ⏱
                    {% if reservation.consultationCreneau.dureeMinutes %}
                        {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.dureeMinutes }} min
                    {% else %}
                        30 min
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- ===== GOOGLE MEET ===== -->
    {% if meetLink %}
    <div style="padding: 28px 0 4px;">
        <div class="meet-block">
            <div class="meet-inner">
                <span class="meet-logo">📹</span>
                <div class="meet-heading">Consultation en vidéoconférence</div>
                <div class="meet-desc">
                    Votre rendez-vous se déroule en ligne via <strong>Google Meet</strong>.<br>
                    Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous pour rejoindre la salle.
                </div>
                <a href="{{ meetLink }}" class="meet-cta">📹 &nbsp;Rejoindre Google Meet</a>
                <div class="meet-link-text">{{ meetLink }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- ===== ÉTAPES À SUIVRE ===== -->
    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
            <div class="section-icon">📋</div>
            <span class="section-label">À faire avant votre consultation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="steps-list">
            <div class="step-row">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Préparez vos documents :</strong> Carnet de santé, ordonnances récentes, résultats d'analyses.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-row">
                <div class="step-num">2</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Arrivez à l'heure :</strong> Présentez-vous 10 minutes avant le début de votre rendez-vous.</div>
            </div>
            {% if meetLink %}
            <div class="step-row">
                <div class="step-num">3</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Testez votre connexion :</strong> Assurez-vous que votre caméra et microphone fonctionnent correctement.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-row">
                <div class="step-num">4</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Rejoignez le Meet :</strong> Cliquez sur le lien Google Meet ci-dessus 5 minutes avant le début.</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="step-row">
                <div class="step-num">{% if meetLink %}5{% else %}3{% endif %}</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>En cas d'empêchement :</strong> Annulez au moins 24h à l'avance en contactant le <strong>+216 XX XXX XXX</strong>.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== ALERTE IMPORTANTE ===== -->
    <div class="alert-row">
        ⚠️ <strong>Important :</strong> Conservez votre numéro de référence <strong>#{{ reservation.reference }}</strong> — il vous sera indispensable pour modifier ou annuler votre rendez-vous. Cet email constitue votre preuve de réservation officielle.
    </div>

    <!-- ===== FOOTER ===== -->
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-brand">🌸 Maternia</div>
        <div class="footer-tagline">Votre santé maternelle &amp; pédiatrique, notre priorité</div>
        <div class="footer-sep"></div>
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="#" class="footer-link">Centre d'aide</a>
            <a href="#" class="footer-link">Conditions d'utilisation</a>
            <a href="#" class="footer-link">Confidentialité</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-copy">
            © {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Maternia Clinique. Tous droits réservés.<br>
            Cet email a été envoyé à {{ reservation.emailClient }}
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
